---
title: Upgrade · evidence before effects
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> AvailabilityUnknown
  AvailabilityUnknown --> Checking : Review click
  Checking --> AvailabilityUnknown : no target evidence
  Checking --> Blocked : incomplete readiness
  Checking --> Ready : verified target, ready
  Blocked --> Checking : Check again
  Ready --> Snapshotting : Save snapshot click
  Snapshotting --> Incomplete : refused or gaps
  Snapshotting --> Ready : complete receipt
  Incomplete --> Checking : Check again
  Ready --> Applying : Upgrade click, complete snapshot
  Applying --> Checking : Check again
  Checking --> Done : all fresh evidence
  Checking --> Unknown : evidence missing
  Unknown --> Checking : Check again
  Unknown --> Restarting : Restart click
  Restarting --> Checking : fresh versions match
  Restarting --> Failed : mismatch or error
  Failed --> RollingBack : Restore click, complete snapshot
  RollingBack --> Restored : every file restored
  RollingBack --> Failed : partial or refused
  Restored --> Checking : Review click
  note right of Ready
    INV target evidence AND complete snapshot
    required before terminal upgrade.
    Live target discovery needs R14.
  end note
  note right of Done
    INV CLI and installed app equal target,
    daemon equals CLI, ready empty plan,
    every previous scope and id explicitly ok.
    Missing evidence stays Unknown.
  end note
  note right of Restored
    INV files only, never versions,
    containers or services.
  end note
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef wait stroke-dasharray:2 2
  classDef fail stroke-width:2px
  class Done,Restored ok
  class Checking,Snapshotting,Applying,Restarting,RollingBack wait
  class Blocked,Incomplete,Failed,Unknown fail
